# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository.
#
# Windows checkout conversion produces a CRLF working tree, which makes every
# file look modified after a fresh clone on some configurations. Pinning LF
# keeps the repository checkout-stable across Linux, macOS and Windows.

* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.webm binary
*.mp4 binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
